OL,3,GNEWSARedevelopment aims to reduce
OL,4,Atraffic around port
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major redevelopment is now under way
OL,7,Fat the Port of Dover, aiming to ease
OL,8,Fcongestion and reduce reliance on
OL,9,Ftraffic management systems in the
OL,10,Fsurrounding area.
OL,12,FThe #40m Dover Border Access
OL,13,FImprovement Scheme will reconfigure
OL,14,Fborder control facilities within the
OL,15,Feastern docks, creating capacity for up
OL,16,Fto 500 additional lorries and expanding
OL,17,Fspace for border processing booths.
OL,19,FBBC South East has been given exclusive
OL,20,Faccess to the port as construction
OL,21,Fstarts.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
