OL,3,GNEWSARedevelopment aims to reduce
OL,4,Atraffic around port
OL,5,
OL,6,FPort chief executive Doug Bannister
OL,7,Fsaid the improvements could mean two
OL,8,Ftraffic management measures are needed
OL,9,Ffar less often during periods of
OL,10,Fdisruption and peak demand.
